---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import { products } from '../data/site';
---

<Site
  title="Viber Ops — 为研发与运维构建的工具"
  description="Viber Ops 的运维产品与使用文档。从 Configra 开始，集中管理应用配置、敏感值与机器访问。"
  section="products"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> BUILT FOR THE PEOPLE WHO OPERATE
          </p>
          <h1>
            系统更有序。
            <br />
            <span>运维更从容。</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">
            为研发与运维打造的工具。
            <br />
            从应用配置开始，把分散的日常操作变成清晰、可追溯的工作流。
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button button-light" href="/configra/">
              认识 Configra <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
            <a class="text-link light-link" href="/docs/configra/">
              阅读文档 ↗
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-note">
            <span>SELF-HOSTED</span>
            <span>DEVELOPER-FOCUSED</span>
            <span>KUBERNETES-READY</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-product">
          <div class="window-caption">
            <span>
              <span class="mini-mark">c</span> Configra <span class="preview-pill">Preview</span>
            </span>
            <span class="window-label">VAULT WORKSPACE</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/configra/" aria-label="了解 Configra 配置与敏感值管理">
            <img
              src="/assets/configra/vault-light.png"
              alt="Configra 浅色 Vault 界面：左侧资源导航、中央条目列表与右侧字段详情。画面使用演示数据。"
              width="1440"
              height="1000"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="product-caption">
            <span>
              <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> 配置与敏感值，各归其位
            </span>
            <span>01 / CONFIGRA</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="products" class="section container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">THE TOOLKIT</p>
          <h2>从一个真正需要的工具开始。</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          独立的产品，统一的入口。
          <br />
          按你的系统需要选择和部署。
        </p>
      </div>
      {products.map((product) => (
        <article class="product-row">
          <div class="product-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            c<span>_</span>
          </div>
          <div class="product-description">
            <p class="eyebrow">{product.category}</p>
            <h3>
              <a href={product.href}>{product.name}</a>
              <span class="tag">{product.status}</span>
            </h3>
            <p>{product.description}</p>
            <div class="inline-tags">
              <span>YAML / JSON</span>
              <span>Vault</span>
              <span>mTLS</span>
              <span>Kubernetes</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="product-links">
            <a class="button button-primary" href={product.href}>
              查看产品 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/docs/configra/quickstart/">
              开始本地体验
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </section>
    <section class="principles section container">
      <div>
        <span class="index-label">01 / OWN YOUR RUNTIME</span>
        <h3>运行在你的基础设施里</h3>
        <p>服务、配置和密钥由你部署与管理。明确依赖，也明确数据留在哪里。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="index-label">02 / KNOW THE BOUNDARIES</span>
        <h3>能力与边界，一起说清楚</h3>
        <p>不只介绍功能。权限范围、更新行为和发布状态，都写进使用文档。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="index-label">03 / GET TO WORK</span>
        <h3>从接入到维护，有路可循</h3>
        <p>本地体验、SDK、Kubernetes、备份与升级，为完整使用周期提供指引。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="docs-banner container">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">READ. RUN. UNDERSTAND.</p>
        <h2>下一步，把 Configra 跑起来。</h2>
        <p>先了解工作方式，再接入你的第一个应用。</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/docs/configra/quickstart/">
        打开使用指南 →
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Site>
